<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #1f4632; padding: 2rem; max-width: 600px;">
  <h1 style="font-size: 1.5rem;">You're a listed Gooi facility</h1>
  <p style="font-size: 1.05rem;">Hi <%= @user.first_name || @site.contact_name %>,</p>
  <p style="font-size: 1.05rem;">
    We've received and approved your signed letter, so <strong><%= @site.name %></strong> is now a listed facility
    on Gooi's City of Cape Town accreditation. Thank you for composting our food scraps.
  </p>
  <%# Cost is only ever mentioned to sites that charge. %>
  <% if @site.charges_disposal_fee? %>
    <p style="font-size: 1.05rem;">
      That means we're clear to pay you. Once we have your banking details we'll pay what we owe you each month.
    </p>
  <% end %>
  <p style="font-size: 1.05rem;">Alfred's Gooi</p>
</div>
